  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/373",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">새학기 평가계획 세우시느라</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">선생님들이 고민이 많으시죠?</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">작년에 생명과학2</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">광합성과 호흡의 상호작용을 인포그래픽으로 제작하는 학습활동을 하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">올해는</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이 활동을 수행평가로 하고 싶은데,</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">평가계획&amp;채점루브릭을 어떻게 작성해야 할지 고민이 됩니다.&#160;&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5fc0317976fc2835ea4b11f999c6b1b5346cd6b8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"336\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5fc0317976fc2835ea4b11f999c6b1b5346cd6b8\" data-origin-width=\"1058\" data-origin-height=\"593\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그래서&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3분만에 평가계획을 뚝딱 만들어주는</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#39;수행평가 루브릭 AI생성기&#39;를 제작하였습니다~</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1.&#160;우선&#160;프로그램&#160;사용법&#160;영상을&#160;시청하시고요.<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/SDeyXtNs7hw\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/SDeyXtNs7hw</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SDeyXtNs7hw\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"600\" data-video-height=\"337\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AAisf/dJMb9kl91Oo/AZk6KIqSTSfvZ8CjglQ6e1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/KG8WZ/dJMb9kT0caL/1IAvqKLAssanar2Bksi4L0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/tRqmT/dJMb9iIEla3/Kf5JrxKEBmKIwck1EiwLkk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SDeyXtNs7hw\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2. &#160;3분 만에 뚝딱! ~~ 평가계획이 완성됩니다~</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;1)&#160;구글&#160;크롬에서&#160;구글&#160;계정으로&#160;로그인&#160;하기</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>&#160;2) 아래의 주소를 클릭하고 평가 정보를 입력하기</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160; &#160;: 수행평가 아이디어 중심으로 작성해주세요.<br><br><a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/9878526e24a3\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/9878526e24a3</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/80b9f949e937678aed6406aca5fa549b37dc0e5e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" height=\"406\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/80b9f949e937678aed6406aca5fa549b37dc0e5e\" data-origin-width=\"1245\" data-origin-height=\"777\"></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 353px;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 30px;\"><td style=\"width: 61.6352%; height: 30px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>표를 복사하여 엑셀에서 편집하기</b></span></td><td style=\"width: 38.239%; height: 30px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>* 루브릭 화면의 아래 쪽에</b></span><br><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&#160; 우수 교과세특 예시까지 제공됨!</b></span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 323px;\"><td style=\"width: 61.6352%; height: 323px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16c06d88d86924c02500987546a8b716762d6e74\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"453\" height=\"280\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/16c06d88d86924c02500987546a8b716762d6e74\" data-origin-width=\"862\" data-origin-height=\"533\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9c2ff78aa152949ddf371b991d0c41607c8f381\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"454\" height=\"190\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9c2ff78aa152949ddf371b991d0c41607c8f381\" data-origin-width=\"863\" data-origin-height=\"362\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 38.239%; height: 323px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7be2417fa3720c788608fe44e50056bc5c43e131\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7be2417fa3720c788608fe44e50056bc5c43e131\" data-origin-width=\"633\" data-origin-height=\"681\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>수업&amp;평가&amp;기록의 일체화를 꿈꿉니다!</b></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
